## Column Width Guidelines

**Total usable width for A4 with 1" margins: ~9300 DXA**

### By Content Type
| Content Type | Width (DXA) |
|--------------|-------------|
| Single char / dash | 700-850 |
| Percentage (40%) | 800-900 |
| Short text (1-3 words) | 1000-1400 |
| Medium text (4-8 words) | 1600-2200 |
| Long text (sentences) | 2800-4500 |
| Row labels (first col) | 1600-2000 |
| Highlight column | 1000-1200 |

### By Table Type

**For 4-column tables (total ~9300 DXA):**
- Column 1 (Labels): 1800 DXA (~19%)
- Column 2: 2500 DXA (~27%)
- Column 3: 2800 DXA (~30%)
- Column 4: 2200 DXA (~24%)

**For 3-column tables:**
- Equal: 3100 DXA each
- 40/30/30: 3700, 2800, 2800 DXA

**For 2-column tables:**
- Equal: 4650 DXA each
- 30/70: 2800, 6500 DXA

**For 10-column matrix tables:**
- Column 1 (Row labels): 1800 DXA
- Columns 2-9 (Data): 850 DXA each
- Column 10 (Highlight): 1100 DXA
